# A routed value no begin was answered for is a value still: a stop gives it back to the value queue, whose stop drain
# sends it in a list frame (20000 bytes of "a" are about 60000 bytes of JSON: it fits). Here its registration is never
# acknowledged (every commands request fails), so it waits.

